#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
"Core of the conversation-intelligence pipeline (task t29807). A\n"
"``conversation.record`` holds one recorded call or meeting: the audio, the\n"
"participants, the transcript split per speaker and the transcription state.\n"
"\n"
"Transcription runs from a cron through the ``gateway_ml`` provider stack. No audio\n"
"leaves the company unless its ``conversation.transcription.policy`` for that\n"
"kind of conversation names an external speech-to-text vendor (a ``gateway.ml.provider``\n"
"with audio models) and allows it explicitly. Every record keeps who transcribed it.\n"
"\n"
"Domain vocabulary (``conversation.vocabulary``) is sent to the vendor as key\n"
"terms so product brands, crops and places come back spelled right.\n"
"\n"
"Analysis, proposed actions and the live panel are built on top of this module\n"
"by ``conversation_ai`` and ``conversation_meeting``.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_account
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Accounting\n"
"==========================\n"
"\n"
"Adds the Accounting tools to the conversation catalog. Installs itself when both\n"
"``conversation_ai`` and ``account`` are present.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_ai
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Analysis and Actions\n"
"====================================\n"
"\n"
"Once a conversation is transcribed, an analyst call to the LLM (Claude through\n"
"``api_ai_agent``) returns one structured document: summary and outcome, action\n"
"items, questions, key moments, coaching recommendations, per-participant\n"
"metrics, and **proposed actions**.\n"
"\n"
"Actions are open-ended. A proposed action names a tool from the catalog: any\n"
"``ir.actions.server`` on ``conversation.record`` flagged *Use in AI* and *Offer\n"
"in conversations*, so a new kind of action is configuration, not code. The\n"
"tools that need Sales, Manufacturing or Accounting live in ``conversation_sale``,\n"
"``conversation_mrp`` and ``conversation_account``, which install themselves with\n"
"those apps. Every tool carries a risk level and the group that may approve it.\n"
"Nothing runs until a person approves; approval executes the tool through the\n"
"same ``_ai_tool_run`` Odoo's own agents use.\n"
"\n"
"Per-participant sentiment and engagement live in ``conversation.participant.metric``,\n"
"readable only by leaders and managers.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_mobile
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Company Phones\n"
"==============================\n"
"\n"
"Bridge between ``remote_mobile`` and ``conversation``. When the companion app\n"
"uploads a call recording, a ``conversation.record`` of kind *call* is created\n"
"with the audio, the customer the call log matched and the phone's user as the\n"
"responsible (none when the handset has no user), and it is queued for\n"
"transcription. A recording that arrives before its call log gets its customer,\n"
"its name and its customer participant when the hourly reconciliation links\n"
"them. The conversation keeps its phone and call log after the recording itself\n"
"is vacuumed.\n"
"\n"
"A ``remote.device`` gains a *Phone user*: the employee who carries the handset.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_mrp
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Manufacturing\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Adds the Manufacturing tools to the conversation catalog. Installs itself when both\n"
"``conversation_ai`` and ``mrp`` are present.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_meeting
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Meetings\n"
"========================\n"
"\n"
"A calendar event starts (or reopens) its conversation: attendees become\n"
"participants and the meeting-room device (a ``remote.device`` in the *Meeting\n"
"Room* category, the only category these routes accept) uploads the recording to\n"
"``/conversation/<id>/audio`` with its Bearer token, the same inbound gate company\n"
"phones use. While it records it can stream 15-second chunks to\n"
"``/conversation/<id>/chunk``; the moderator's form follows them over the bus on\n"
"``conversation.live/<id>``, which the websocket layer serves only to people who\n"
"can read the conversation, and a cron asks the coach for notices every few\n"
"chunks. ``tools/record-room.sh`` is the room-side script: audio preflight,\n"
"moderator confirmation, ffmpeg recording (Opus) and upload.\n"
"\n"
"Once analyzed, the conversation exports a Markdown minute in the layout the\n"
"team already reads (Contexto, Temas, Decisiones, Action Items, Tareas Odoo).\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_purchase
msgid ""
"\n"
"Conversations - Purchase\n"
"========================\n"
"\n"
"Adds the *create purchase order* tool to the conversation catalog: a call or a\n"
"meeting with a supplier can propose a draft request for quotation with the\n"
"products and quantities said. Purchasing confirms it.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_conversation_sale
msgid ""
