#. module: base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_remote_machines
msgid ""
"\n"
"IoT Machines - Counter Telemetry\n"
"================================\n"
"\n"
"Counter-machine behaviour on ``remote.device``, for PLCs publishing a\n"
"cumulative production counter over MQTT (Etiquetadora, Llenadora, ...).\n"
"\n"
"* counter devices are flagged by the ``counter_plc`` device category -- no\n"
"  parallel model\n"
"* the cumulative counter is aggregated into hourly buckets, one row per\n"
"  (device, hour): ~17,520 rows/year for two machines against ~4.2M raw pings\n"
"* the weekly PLC counter reset (payload ``Conteo=0``) is detected and rolls\n"
"  over to a new bucket\n"
"* the override of ``_mqtt_on_message`` dispatches counter payloads to the\n"
"  aggregator and skips the raw ``remote.data.log`` write, reusing the\n"
"  ``remote`` module's persistent MQTT v5 client and connection lifecycle\n"
msgstr ""

